zxing-cpp
------------------------------------------
C++ Multi-format 1D/2D barcode image processing library

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libZXing-devel-3.1.1-1bl1
  libZXing4-3.1.1-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libzint2.16-2.16.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libpng-devel-1.6.59-1
  libzint-devel-2.16.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/zxing-cpp/zxing-cpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/zxing-cpp/zxing-cpp/archive/refs/tags/v3.1.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack zxing-cpp-3.1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./zxing-cpp-3.1.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/zxing-cpp-3.1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/zxing-cpp-3.1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libZXing4-3.1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libZXing-devel-3.1.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(zxing-cpp)
  /usr/bin/ZXingReader.exe
  /usr/bin/ZXingWriter.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/zxing-cpp.README
  /usr/share/doc/zxing-cpp/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/zxing-cpp/README.md

(libZXing4)
  /usr/bin/cygZXing-4.dll

(libZXing-devel)
  /usr/include/ZXing/Barcode.h
